summary:
  Today's radiology news highlights advancements in AI for mammography interpretation, ongoing efforts to address radiologic technologist shortages through apprenticeships, and interesting findings in basic science research with potential implications for neurological and metabolic health. Several articles focus on novel insights into aging, immunity, and even the gut microbiome.

